{"lines":[{"h":0.013630353030385955,"c":1,"t":"Test 2","x":0.091157228629438591,"y":0.044783660671451231,"w":0.060403989156087246},{"x":0.091145017497175906,"y":0.088392970647555247,"w":0.77693949381510419,"c":1,"h":0.023097930147640389,"t":"For safety's sake, then, we want the machines to be ethically as well as cognitively"},{"y":0.10743413064270968,"x":0.089192946245595789,"w":0.78087839762369793,"t":"superhuman. We want them to aim for the moral high ground, not for the troughs in","h":0.022733344912900244,"c":1},{"x":0.09110580177746376,"w":0.80413635253906246,"t":"which many of us spend some of our time. Luckily they'll be smart enough for the job.","y":0.1260544729249351,"h":0.022871044788776551,"c":1},{"y":0.14448717028156888,"t":"If there are routes to the moral high ground, they'll be better than us at finding them, and","c":1,"h":0.023421473517967528,"w":0.82940465291341148,"x":0.0892153395753085},{"h":0.019680129553298675,"c":1,"w":0.305147705078125,"y":0.16686369678033897,"t":"steering us in the right direction.","x":0.091090496788372999},{"x":0.091091676331365931,"w":0.7538086446126302,"y":0.20023680566647539,"c":1,"h":0.024347579813449149,"t":"However, there are two big problems with this utopian vision. One is how we get"},{"t":"the machines started on the journey, the other is what it would mean to reach this","y":0.21934797462022282,"w":0.76535430908203128,"x":0.089189063167525826,"h":0.022786321669724052,"c":1},{"x":0.09116148014358913,"y":0.23801243670878747,"t":"destination. The 'getting started' problem is that we need to tell the machines what","w":0.77497406005859359,"c":1,"h":0.021904949532862483},{"h":0.021069937257380489,"t":"they're looking for with sufficient clarity that we can be confident they will find it -","w":0.75938308715820313,"c":1,"x":0.091180969273902221,"y":0.25811628543745724},{"t":"whatever 'it' actually turns out to be. This won't be easy, given that we are tribal","h":0.021548542723848874,"c":1,"x":0.091144408105052338,"y":0.27602701171875021,"w":0.74588638305664068},{"h":0.020058070387795723,"x":0.093102592560686717,"t":"creatures and conflicted about the ideals ourselves. We often ignore the suffering of","w":0.78856552124023427,"c":1,"y":0.29473018159648046},{"c":1,"x":0.0911054152462729,"y":0.31234924145414378,"w":0.8178123474121094,"t":"strangers, and even contribute to it, at least indirectly. How then, do we point machines","h":0.025222604816947714},{"h":0.019277144815320169,"x":0.089209062750750162,"y":0.33422594400701411,"w":0.34204104105631516,"t":"in the direction of something better?","c":1},{"w":0.7923897806803385,"y":0.36900237740933162,"h":0.021364562607999904,"x":0.093127086384757835,"c":1,"t":"As for the 'destination' problem, we might, by putting ourselves in the hands of these"},{"c":1,"x":0.093021982855867977,"t":"moral guides and gatekeepers, be sacrificing our own autonomy - an important part","w":0.78876958211263037,"h":0.025334861493927718,"y":0.38582634852521402},{"c":1,"t":"of what makes us human. Machines who are better than us at sticking to the moral","x":0.093081612446647075,"h":0.02164884430597136,"w":0.7789024353027344,"y":0.40645237079472696},{"y":0.42524239295204702,"h":0.021971280106874325,"c":1,"x":0.093090312313568499,"t":"high ground may be expected to discourage some of the lapses we presently take for","w":0.80222142537434904},{"h":0.02197738124574089,"c":1,"x":0.093082226047434435,"w":0.80990346272786473,"t":"granted. We might lose our freedom to discriminate in favour of our own communities,","y":0.44346617388667542},{"w":0.12255013783772788,"x":0.091152116224470961,"h":0.016955579478421301,"y":0.46608616358390831,"t":"for example.","c":1},{"y":0.49847590266350283,"w":0.78866038004557293,"c":1,"x":0.094991288545890507,"t":"Loss of freedom to behave badly isn't always a bad thing, of course: denying ourselves","h":0.0235979074258299},{"t":"the freedom to put children to work in factories, or to smoke in restaurants are signs of","w":0.78678802490234367,"c":1,"h":0.024396964099919649,"y":0.51689080797694953,"x":0.093035109284832912},{"h":0.022745297630999417,"w":0.81392186482747397,"t":"progress. But are we ready for ethical silicon police limiting our options? They might be so","x":0.094965130311661594,"y":0.53598057534595345,"c":1},{"h":0.023492107213100466,"t":"good at doing it that we won't notice them; but few of us are likely to welcome such a future.","y":0.55423171970223695,"x":0.09497964821389332,"w":0.8332810465494791,"c":1},{"w":0.75957021077473952,"h":0.023332415191555267,"c":1,"x":0.095007816149168409,"t":"These issues might seem far-fetched, but they are to some extent already here. Al","y":0.59236730747163036},{"h":0.021883384015329854,"c":1,"w":0.83327041625976561,"t":"already has some input into how resources are used in our National Health Service (NHS)","x":0.09500409217452481,"y":0.61078431462097238},{"x":0.09500838843170413,"y":0.62912555558574479,"t":"here in the UK, for example. If it was given a greater role, it might do so much more","h":0.024500493319977834,"w":0.76925338745117189,"c":1},{"x":0.094938826149958591,"w":0.81984649658203135,"h":0.027548227280471238,"c":1,"t":"efficiently than humans can manage, and act in the interests of taxpayers and those who","y":0.64582821320846617},{"h":0.024719518738743673,"w":0.82555425008138017,"y":0.66591164661250413,"t":"use the health system. However, we'd be depriving some humans (e.g. senior doctors) of","x":0.0969337530059039,"c":1},{"w":0.83331151326497399,"t":"the control they presently enjoy. Since we'd want to ensure that people are treated equally","c":1,"x":0.094991874290632272,"y":0.68465075281401366,"h":0.024094368289935608},{"c":1,"x":0.096980405343251821,"y":0.70588297766278751,"w":0.70698348999023441,"h":0.020501592523212375,"t":"and that policies are fair, the goals of Al would need to be specified correctly."},{"t":"We have a new powerful technology to deal with - itself, literally, a new way of thinking.","x":0.096991632586939533,"h":0.021777973590981548,"y":0.74234146490731645,"w":0.8215341186523436,"c":1},{"w":0.80417322794596358,"t":"For our own safety, we need to point these new thinkers in the right direction, and get","y":0.76013810234776735,"h":0.022807434414777505,"x":0.09888872154386566,"c":1},{"x":0.095038928074882276,"t":"them to act well for us. It is not yet clear whether this is possible, but if it is, it will require","c":1,"w":0.82744481404622405,"y":0.77890050861853377,"h":0.023448689778645782},{"h":0.025000487235476321,"x":0.09685087125219359,"t":"a cooperative spirit, and a willingness to set aside self-interest.","y":0.79680891939954113,"c":1,"w":0.59261062622070304},{"w":0.80805313110351551,"t":"Both general intelligence and moral reasoning are often thought to be uniquely human","c":1,"h":0.022458447845554064,"x":0.098886168834364699,"y":0.8347122313702553},{"x":0.098894029850900247,"y":0.85396221972637509,"w":0.81387568155924483,"t":"capacities. But safety seems to require that we think of them as a package: if we are to","h":0.021608218374281951,"c":1},{"x":0.096964398058241086,"h":0.022549806874117784,"t":"give general intelligence to machines, we'll need to give them moral authority, too. And","y":0.87159748644459534,"c":1,"w":0.81382502237955734},{"h":0.022085959889064366,"c":1,"y":0.89143665974485098,"x":0.096961825334102414,"t":"where exactly would that leave human beings? All the more reason to think about the","w":0.80608825683593754},{"h":0.024396695526218148,"x":0.098795698995781098,"c":1,"t":"destination now, and to be careful about what we wish for.","y":0.91027279872564193,"w":0.54605443318684888},{"w":0.025242718060811367,"c":1,"t":"44","y":0.96220930239709268,"x":0.099029126309400153,"h":0.011627906728013615}],"w":2400,"h":3209}